We need to consider the domain actions and their preconditions/effects.

Let's list actions relevant:

- create candidate: create_candidate (but all candidates already created)
- allocate_vehicle_unit: allocate vehicle to candidate (requires candidate_created, not vehicle_allocated, vehicle_available)
- attach_task_profile: attach route_task_profile to candidate (requires candidate_created, vehicle_allocated, route_task_profile_available)
- confirm_candidate_preparedness: set candidate_prepared (requires candidate_created, vehicle_allocated, candidate_task_profile_linked, not candidate_prepared)
- detach_task_profile: opposite
- assign_operator_resource: link operator to candidate (requires candidate_prepared, operator_available)
- release_operator_resource: opposite
- assign_skill_certificate: link skill certificate to schedule_candidate (requires candidate_prepared, skill_certificate_available)
- release_skill_certificate: opposite
- assign_compliance_certificate: link compliance certificate to schedule_candidate (requires candidate_prepared, compliance_certificate_available)
- release_compliance_certificate: opposite
- activate_origin_node: set origin_node_ready (requires candidate_prepared, candidate_task_profile_linked, origin_availability_node_linked, not origin_node_ready, not origin_node_occupied)
- lock_origin_availability: set origin_availability_locked and origin_availability_confirmed (requires candidate_prepared, candidate_operator_linked, origin_availability_node_linked, origin_node_ready, not origin_availability_locked)
- load_origin_payload: set origin_node_occupied, origin_availability_locked, origin_payload_linked, not cargo_available (requires candidate_prepared, origin_availability_node_linked, cargo_available, not origin_availability_locked)
- unload_origin_payload: reverse
- activate_destination_node: set destination_node_ready (requires candidate_prepared, candidate_task_profile_linked, destination_availability_node_linked, not destination_node_ready, not destination_node_occupied)
- lock_destination_availability: set destination_availability_locked and destination_availability_confirmed (requires candidate_prepared, candidate_operator_linked, destination_availability_node_linked, destination_node_ready, not destination_availability_locked)
- load_destination_payload: set destination_node_occupied, destination_availability_locked, destination_payload_linked, not cargo_available (requires candidate_prepared, destination_availability_node_linked, cargo_available, not destination_availability_locked)
- unload_destination_payload: reverse
- assemble_transport_leg: set transport_leg_assembled, origin_linked, destination_linked (requires origin_availability_locked, destination_availability_locked, origin_availability_node_linked, destination_availability_node_linked, origin_node_ready, destination_node_ready, origin_availability_confirmed, destination_availability_confirmed, transport_leg_available)
- assemble_origin_loaded_leg: similar but origin_node_occupied, destination_node_ready, origin_availability_confirmed, destination_availability_confirmed, not origin_availability_confirmed? Wait precondition includes not origin_availability_confirmed? Actually assemble_origin_loaded_leg precondition includes (origin_availability_locked ?origin_availability) (destination_availability_locked ?destination_availability) (origin_availability_node_linked ?origin_availability ?origin_node) (destination_availability_node_linked ?destination_availability ?destination_node) (origin_node_occupied ?origin_node) (destination_node_ready ?destination_node) (not (origin_availability_confirmed ?origin_availability)) (destination_availability_confirmed ?destination_availability) (transport_leg_available ?transport_leg). So origin not confirmed, destination confirmed.
- assemble_destination_loaded_leg: origin_node_ready, destination_node_occupied, origin_availability_confirmed, not destination_availability_confirmed.
- assemble_fully_loaded_leg: origin_node_occupied, destination_node_occupied, not origin_availability_confirmed, not destination_availability_confirmed.
- authorize_transport_leg_loading: set transport_leg_loading_authorized (requires transport_leg_assembled, origin_availability_locked, candidate_task_profile_linked ?origin_availability ?route_task_profile, not transport_leg_loading_authorized)
- load_container_onto_leg: set loading_container_loaded, loading_container_leg_linked, not loading_container_available (requires candidate_prepared, candidate_transport_leg_linked ?candidate ?transport_leg, candidate_loading_container_linked ?candidate ?loading_container, loading_container_available ?loading_container, transport_leg_assembled ?transport_leg, transport_leg_loading_authorized ?transport_leg, not loading_container_loaded ?loading_container)
- stage_schedule_candidate: set candidate_staged_for_loading (requires candidate_prepared, candidate_loading_container_linked ?candidate ?loading_container, transport_leg ?transport_leg, route_task_profile ?route_task_profile, not candidate_staged_for_loading ?candidate)
- verify_loading_profile_nominal: set candidate_loading_verified (requires candidate_staged_for_loading ?candidate, candidate_skill_certificate_linked ?candidate ?skill_certificate, candidate_operator_linked ?candidate ?operator_resource, candidate_loading_container_linked ?candidate ?loading_container, loading_container_leg_linked ?loading_container ?transport_leg, not destination_leg_loaded ?transport_leg, not candidate_loading_verified ?candidate)
- mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready: set dispatch_ready ?origin_availability (requires origin_availability_locked, origin_availability_confirmed, transport_leg_assembled ?transport_leg, transport_leg_loading_authorized ?transport_leg, not dispatch_ready ?origin_availability)
- mark_destination_availability_dispatch_ready: similar for destination.
- allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate: set dispatch_allocated ?candidate, candidate_dispatch_slot_linked ?candidate ?dispatch_slot, not dispatch_slot_available ?dispatch_slot (requires dispatch_ready ?candidate, candidate_task_profile_linked ?candidate ?route_task_profile, dispatch_slot_available ?dispatch_slot, not dispatch_allocated ?candidate)
- execute_origin_dispatch: set dispatched ?origin_availability, vehicle_available ?vehicle_unit, dispatch_slot_available ?dispatch_slot (requires dispatch_allocated ?origin_availability, candidate_vehicle_linked ?origin_availability ?vehicle_unit, candidate_dispatch_slot_linked ?origin_availability ?dispatch_slot, not dispatched ?origin_availability)
- execute_destination_dispatch: similar for destination.
- execute_schedule_dispatch: set dispatched ?candidate, vehicle_available ?vehicle_unit, dispatch_slot_available ?dispatch_slot (requires dispatch_allocated ?candidate, candidate_vehicle_linked ?candidate ?vehicle_unit, candidate_dispatch_slot_linked ?candidate ?dispatch_slot, not dispatched ?candidate)
- verify_compliance_certificate: set compliance_validation_complete ?candidate (requires operator_alignment_confirmed ?candidate, candidate_compliance_certificate_linked ?candidate ?compliance_certificate, not compliance_validation_complete ?candidate)
- verify_loading_profile_nominal: set candidate_loading_verified ?candidate (requires candidate_staged_for_loading ?candidate, candidate_skill_certificate_linked ?candidate ?skill_certificate, candidate_operator_linked ?candidate ?operator_resource, candidate_loading_container_linked ?candidate ?loading_container, loading_container_leg_linked ?loading_container ?transport_leg, not destination_leg_loaded ?transport_leg, not candidate_loading_verified ?candidate)
